      "prompt": "A school purchases $14$ workbooks at $36$ dollars each and $8$ lab packs at $45$ dollars each, then applies a voucher worth $6$ dollars. If the remaining balance is divided equally into $6$ monthly installments, what is the dollar amount of each installment?",
